        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This parameter describes the usage of one or two channels, i.e. current line paths, for the use of transmitting Power for Charging and/or Discharging. In the single Channel Configuration the Power Transfer Channel is shared between charging and discharging. With the dual Channel Configuration there are two separate power transfer channels, one for the charging and one for discharging.",
