            "block_content": "The GeneratorMode parameter indicates if the system  $ \\{EV + EVSE\\} $ operates as a grid following generator (only injecting active and reactive power) or as a grid forming generator, which is able to control the voltage and frequency of the network. For more details see 8.4.2.",
